{{% choosable language hcl %}}

Declare the provider in your program, then run `pulumi install`:

```hcl
terraform {
  required_providers {
    cosign = {
      source  = "chainguard-dev/cosign"
      version = "0.4.19"
    }
  }
}
```

```bash
pulumi install
```

